{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 13 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">配准与投影几何：可微变换、拓扑约束和 SE(3) 闭环</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Registration &amp; SE(3)</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_070_diffpose-title\">DiffPose</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">合成 DRR 训练的 pose initializer 与可微 X-ray renderer 驱动的 SE(3) 测试时优化闭环结合。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Couples a patient-specific SE(3) pose initializer (trained self-supervised on synthetic DRRs) with test-time gradient optimization through a differentiable X-ray ray-casting renderer.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">术前 CT 体 V、术中 2D X-ray y、投影标定参数</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Preoperative 3D CT volume V, intraoperative 2D X-ray fluoroscopy image y, and C-arm intrinsic calibration</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">CT 到 X-ray 的刚体 SE(3) 位姿 T_hat</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Sub-millimeter 6-DoF rigid pose T̂ ∈ SE(3) aligning preoperative CT to intraoperative X-ray</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2024/html/Gopalakrishnan_Intraoperative_2D3D_Image_Registration_via_Differentiable_X-ray_Rendering_CVPR_2024_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_070_diffpose')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_070_diffpose')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"DiffPose original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/3be6ffd699d13b8efbdf.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_070_diffpose', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_070_diffpose\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_070_diffpose')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_070_diffpose', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_070_diffpose\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">术前 CT</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Preoperative 3D CT</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">带物理空间信息的 3D attenuation volume</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests preoperative 3d ct volume v, intraoperative 2d x-ray fluoroscopy image y, and c-arm intrinsic calibration and prepares initial tensor representations (Preoperative 3D CT).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"带物理空间信息的 3D attenuation volume\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests preoperative 3d ct volume v, intraoperative 2d x-ray fluoroscopy image y, and c-arm intrinsic calibration and prepares initial tensor representations (Preoperative 3D CT).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"术前 CT\" data-node-name-en=\"Preoperative 3D CT\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_070_diffpose', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">术前 CT</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Preoperative 3D CT</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">带物理空间信息的 3D attenuation volume</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests preoperative 3d ct volume v, intraoperative 2d x-ray fluoroscopy image y, and c-arm intrinsic calibration and prepares initial tensor representations (Preoperative 3D CT).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"单幅目标透视图及已知/估计内外参\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Intraoperative 2D X-Ray to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"术中 X-ray\" data-node-name-en=\"Intraoperative 2D X-Ray\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_070_diffpose', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">术中 X-ray</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Intraoperative 2D X-Ray</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">单幅目标透视图及已知/估计内外参</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Intraoperative 2D X-Ray to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从 CT 随机采样 pose 渲染训练图像，提供已知相对位姿\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Synthetic DRR Pairs within the core differentiable 2d3d pose registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"合成 DRR 对\" data-node-name-en=\"Synthetic DRR Pairs\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_070_diffpose', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">合成 DRR 对</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Synthetic DRR Pairs</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从 CT 随机采样 pose 渲染训练图像，提供已知相对位姿</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Synthetic DRR Pairs within the core differentiable 2d3d pose registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从 X-ray/DRR 特征预测测试时优化的初始 T0\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Pose within the core differentiable 2d3d pose registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Pose 回归器\" data-node-name-en=\"Pose\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_070_diffpose', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Pose 回归器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Pose</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从 X-ray/DRR 特征预测测试时优化的初始 T0</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Pose within the core differentiable 2d3d pose registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用 Lie algebra/geodesic 几何更新旋转和平移\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs SE(3 within the core differentiable 2d3d pose registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"SE(3) 参数\" data-node-name-en=\"SE(3\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_070_diffpose', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">SE(3) 参数</span><span class=\"lang-en\">SE(3</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用 Lie algebra/geodesic 几何更新旋转和平移</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs SE(3 within the core differentiable 2d3d pose registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按 T 对 CT 做射线积分，生成 DRR(T) 并对 pose 求梯度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Differentiable X-Ray Rendering within the core differentiable 2d3d pose registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"可微 X-ray 渲染\" data-node-name-en=\"Differentiable X-Ray Rendering\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_070_diffpose', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">可微 X-ray 渲染</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Differentiable X-Ray Rendering</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按 T 对 CT 做射线积分，生成 DRR(T) 并对 pose 求梯度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Differentiable X-Ray Rendering within the core differentiable 2d3d pose registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"比较 DRR(T) 与真实 X-ray 的局部归一化相关\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs multi-scale LNCC within the core differentiable 2d3d pose registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"稀疏多尺度 LNCC\" data-node-name-en=\"multi-scale LNCC\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_070_diffpose', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">稀疏多尺度 LNCC</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multi-scale LNCC</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">比较 DRR(T) 与真实 X-ray 的局部归一化相关</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs multi-scale LNCC within the core differentiable 2d3d pose registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从 T0 反传图像相似度，迭代更新 SE(3) pose\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Test-Time Optimization to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"测试时优化\" data-node-name-en=\"Test-Time Optimization\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_070_diffpose', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">测试时优化</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Test-Time Optimization</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从 T0 反传图像相似度，迭代更新 SE(3) pose</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Test-Time Optimization to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"收敛后的 2D/3D 刚体配准\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces sub-millimeter 6-dof rigid pose t̂ ∈ se(3) aligning preoperative ct to intraoperative x-ray via T_hat.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"T_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"T_hat\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_070_diffpose', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>T_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">收敛后的 2D/3D 刚体配准</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces sub-millimeter 6-dof rigid pose t̂ ∈ se(3) aligning preoperative ct to intraoperative x-ray via T_hat.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"DiffPose Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 可微 DRR 相似度驱动的 SE(3) 位姿更新</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Geodesic SE(3) Pose Initialization + Differentiable DRR Multiscale LNCC Refinement</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"DiffPose：核心公式 · 可微 DRR 相似度驱动的 SE(3) 位姿更新\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"70\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"17.873692pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.774303 -68.983233 253.578314 17.873692\" width=\"253.578314pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><use id=\"m070_g10-82\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m070_g7-82\"></use><use id=\"m070_g10-185\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m070_g7-185\"></use><use id=\"m070_g10-186\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m070_g7-186\"></use><path d=\"M2.85475 0V-.108683C2.282351-.115929 2.166422-.188385 2.166422-.536171V-4.883507L2.108458-4.897998L.804257-4.238652V-4.137214C.891204-4.173442 .970905-4.202424 .999887-4.216916C1.130307-4.267635 1.253482-4.296617 1.325937-4.296617C1.478094-4.296617 1.543304-4.187933 1.543304-3.956075V-.673837C1.543304-.434734 1.48534-.268086 1.369411-.202876C1.260727-.137666 1.15929-.115929 .854976-.108683V0H2.85475Z\" id=\"m070_g20-49\"></path><path d=\"M3.130082-1.586778C3.130082-1.956301 3.014153-2.296842 2.804032-2.521455C2.65912-2.680857 2.521455-2.767804 2.20265-2.905469C2.702594-3.246011 2.883733-3.514096 2.883733-3.905357C2.883733-4.492247 2.420017-4.897998 1.753425-4.897998C1.391147-4.897998 1.072343-4.774824 .811503-4.542966C.594136-4.347336 .485452-4.158951 .32605-3.724218L.434734-3.695235C.731802-4.224161 1.057852-4.463265 1.514322-4.463265C1.985283-4.4632